      <p>We respectfully seek your approval to implement our <strong>"Alagang Basa at Dunong" Literacy Outreach &amp; Reading Clinic Program</strong> for Batch <strong>${l}</strong>. Under this project, our trained NSTP-LTS student facilitators will conduct the following instructional activities:</p>
